                                "sense_id": "78def63b-99e4-3634-8c40-032b203d63b4",
                                "text": "I will terminate my first book here because my head aches a bit , and I think that the registers of my brain have been somewhat blurred by this septembral vintage..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "126407b9-e8ff-452a-9bd5-4557862a4e6b",
                                "sense_id": "78def63b-99e4-3634-8c40-032b203d63b4",
                                "text": "...and roam from one tavern to another , with haut-bois, flutes, and trumpets, drinking healths, breaking glasses, tossing pots, whitling themselves with septembral juice..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "87a9aba3-2f2e-495b-9b9f-98fa81e12eae",
                                "sense_id": "78def63b-99e4-3634-8c40-032b203d63b4",
                                "text": "Of which race there were few that looked the ptisane, but all of them were perfect lovers of the pure Septembral juice."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
